		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blood-red, towering humanoids formed of lava and ash. Short, black horns and snarling grins.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scimitar +8 (2d10) or 2 fire bolt (far) +5 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources. Fire immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wall of Flame</strong>. 1/day, 20' high curtain of fire, double near length. Touching it deals 4d8 damage. Lasts 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wish</strong>. Cast wish once a week for a mortal, no spellcasting check.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
